  "blockdesc-jaw-crusher": "Crushes coarse muck into raw and fine muck.",
  "blockdesc-sieve": "Turns muck into its host material as rocks, sand, and gravel. Coarse muck produces mostly rock, raw muck produces mostly gravel and rock, and fine muck produces mostly sand and gravel.",
  "blockdesc-smeltpot": "Stores up to 32 layers of muck for low temperature smelting. Add fluxes and additives to improve recovery and process the contents into pig metal.",
  "blockdesc-smeltpot-small": "A smaller raw-clay smelt pot that stores up to 16 layers of muck and supports 2 additive or flux slots.",
  "blockdesc-sluice-baffles": "Used to concentrate and separate ores from host rock. Stores raw and fine muck separately as deposited, up to 800 total concentration. Fine muck is captured at about 60%, raw muck at about 35%, and coarse muck cannot be processed.",
  "blockdesc-stick-sluice-baffles": "A crude early-game sluice made from sticks and dirt. Stores raw and fine muck separately as deposited, up to 400 total concentration, but captures ore at roughly half the rate of proper sluice baffles. Coarse muck cannot be processed.",
  "blockdesc-screen": "Separates raw muck into coarse muck (~75%) and fine muck (~25%). Outputs coarse muck through the back and fine muck out the bottom.",
  "blockdesc-conveyor-split": "Moves muck on top of it to either side at an approximately 50% rate.",
  "blockdesc-conveyor-flat": "Moves muck from on top of it forward one block.",
  "blockdesc-bucketlift-output": "Requires power on this block and automatically powers all bodies below it. Finds the lowest body, takes muck input from the block beneath it, and outputs in the direction the output faces.",
